    "time (default 2026-01-10 08:00:00); hidden sets the hidden attribute; dir makes a directory.",
    "<name>Err makes that query fail with the message; limits lower the script's $LogCapBytes, $MasLogTailBytes and",
    "$DumpMaxBytes.",
    "env: paths under {{BASE}}; '<dir>\\rest' names dir (directly under {{BASE}}) by its 8.3 short name, the way %TEMP%",
    "is the 8.3 short form (PROFIL~1 style) of %LOCALAPPDATA%\\Temp (only on a",
    "volume that makes 8.3 names: gen_golden.ps1 fails elsewhere, the tests skip the scenario)."
